# Build context is the repo root (see Dockerfile), so trim it to just what the image needs.
# BuildKit reads "<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore" in preference to a context-root .dockerignore,
# which lets this stay scoped to the Journal image instead of adding a repo-root file that would
# also affect platform/ builds. Harmlessly ignored by builders that don't support it.
*
!journal/
!deploy/journal/nginx.conf
!deploy/journal/404.html

# Never ship build artifacts or local cruft even from the paths we did allow.
journal/**/*.standalone.html
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/*.bak
